    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An innovative survival horror imbued with the eternal brilliance of dungeon crawling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/Line.PNG?t=1745442867\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/4888f8b6a892410230db5018f3b90bf4.poster.avif?t=1745442867\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/4888f8b6a892410230db5018f3b90bf4.webm?t=1745442867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/4888f8b6a892410230db5018f3b90bf4.mp4?t=1745442867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a confined space with no escape, face relentless attacks from masked humans.  <br>Use your limited resources and wits to survive this desperate situation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/Line.PNG?t=1745442867\" width=800 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/42662ff6e5c4fb2aa0b9559ad49f74f5.poster.avif?t=1745442867\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/42662ff6e5c4fb2aa0b9559ad49f74f5.webm?t=1745442867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/42662ff6e5c4fb2aa0b9559ad49f74f5.mp4?t=1745442867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple combat system with grid-based movement and free camera control. <br>   The only way to survive is to dodge dangers and defeat the approaching masked humans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/Line.PNG?t=1745442867\" width=800 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/3f2e1ed882a39bff8ae4d2109d9718ec.poster.avif?t=1745442867\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/3f2e1ed882a39bff8ae4d2109d9718ec.webm?t=1745442867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/3f2e1ed882a39bff8ae4d2109d9718ec.mp4?t=1745442867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurers must solve the mysteries hidden in the dungeon as they progress.  <br>Only true heroes, possessing both reason and courage, can reach the top of the tower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/Line.PNG?t=1745442867\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/31c3fc22a16fd5ff5bfaf191e3396e7a.webp?t=1745442867\" width=24 height=24 /></span> Dungeon Exploration<br>Explore the ruins, find weapons and armor, and discover ways to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/d88cea13d7c531eefa7fc3c7db972c09.webp?t=1745442867\" width=24 height=24 /></span> Strategic Combat<br>Grid-based movement is crucial for predicting enemy actions and positioning yourself to avoid attacks. Once cornered, there's no escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/864fd23f024c9c03e89f537e3e76392c.webp?t=1745442867\" width=24 height=24 /></span> Ancient Weapons<br>Use melee weapons like swords and spears to defeat fierce enemies. The power to save the world is in your hands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/3fb373a87f3805476261a60efa0209bd.webp?t=1745442867\" width=24 height=24 /></span> Elements and abilities <br>Players can allocate ability points through level-ups and equipment. It's up to you to decide which abilities to enhance.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/4b4d962aeb1322c574668b725244ae07.webp?t=1745442867\" width=24 height=24 /></span> Difficult puzzles <br>Solve puzzles involving switches, pressure plates, and trapdoors. Items and a handy map feature will be helpful.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/Line.PNG?t=1745442867\" width=24 height=24 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Words of the Unknown Brave:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/19f2593a643cfd2e815c10dbb20d46f2.avif?t=1745442867\" width=620 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this age where even legends are forgotten, <br>I heard an intriguing rumor about the Tower of Mask. <br>In that tower, which stands in a place unknown to people, there lurks an evil that heroes should challenge. <br>And those who step in are attacked by humans wearing bizarre masks. <br>I have never heard of anyone who returned safely from the tower. <br>Can I survive and escape from the tower...?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An innovative survival horror imbued with the eternal brilliance of dungeon crawling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/Line.PNG?t=1745442867\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/4888f8b6a892410230db5018f3b90bf4.poster.avif?t=1745442867\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/4888f8b6a892410230db5018f3b90bf4.webm?t=1745442867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/4888f8b6a892410230db5018f3b90bf4.mp4?t=1745442867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a confined space with no escape, face relentless attacks from masked humans.  <br>Use your limited resources and wits to survive this desperate situation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/Line.PNG?t=1745442867\" width=800 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/42662ff6e5c4fb2aa0b9559ad49f74f5.poster.avif?t=1745442867\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/42662ff6e5c4fb2aa0b9559ad49f74f5.webm?t=1745442867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/42662ff6e5c4fb2aa0b9559ad49f74f5.mp4?t=1745442867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple combat system with grid-based movement and free camera control. <br>   The only way to survive is to dodge dangers and defeat the approaching masked humans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/Line.PNG?t=1745442867\" width=800 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/3f2e1ed882a39bff8ae4d2109d9718ec.poster.avif?t=1745442867\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/3f2e1ed882a39bff8ae4d2109d9718ec.webm?t=1745442867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/3f2e1ed882a39bff8ae4d2109d9718ec.mp4?t=1745442867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurers must solve the mysteries hidden in the dungeon as they progress.  <br>Only true heroes, possessing both reason and courage, can reach the top of the tower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/Line.PNG?t=1745442867\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/31c3fc22a16fd5ff5bfaf191e3396e7a.webp?t=1745442867\" width=24 height=24 /></span> Dungeon Exploration<br>Explore the ruins, find weapons and armor, and discover ways to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/d88cea13d7c531eefa7fc3c7db972c09.webp?t=1745442867\" width=24 height=24 /></span> Strategic Combat<br>Grid-based movement is crucial for predicting enemy actions and positioning yourself to avoid attacks. Once cornered, there's no escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/864fd23f024c9c03e89f537e3e76392c.webp?t=1745442867\" width=24 height=24 /></span> Ancient Weapons<br>Use melee weapons like swords and spears to defeat fierce enemies. The power to save the world is in your hands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/3fb373a87f3805476261a60efa0209bd.webp?t=1745442867\" width=24 height=24 /></span> Elements and abilities <br>Players can allocate ability points through level-ups and equipment. It's up to you to decide which abilities to enhance.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/4b4d962aeb1322c574668b725244ae07.webp?t=1745442867\" width=24 height=24 /></span> Difficult puzzles <br>Solve puzzles involving switches, pressure plates, and trapdoors. Items and a handy map feature will be helpful.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/Line.PNG?t=1745442867\" width=24 height=24 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Words of the Unknown Brave:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918410/extras/19f2593a643cfd2e815c10dbb20d46f2.avif?t=1745442867\" width=620 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this age where even legends are forgotten, <br>I heard an intriguing rumor about the Tower of Mask. <br>In that tower, which stands in a place unknown to people, there lurks an evil that heroes should challenge. <br>And those who step in are attacked by humans wearing bizarre masks. <br>I have never heard of anyone who returned safely from the tower. <br>Can I survive and escape from the tower...?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Tower of Mask is a thrilling survival horror in the spirit of the 80's dungeon crawlers. The most claustrophobic dungeon in modern times is yours to venture through alone. Hero, face the ancient tower where eerie masked humans prowl.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, French, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Indonesian, Polish, Traditional Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe Best New Dungeon Crawler In Over A Decade\u201d<br>Kotaku<br><br>\u201c&quot;Tower of Mask&quot; is a fantastic Dungeon Master-like with incredible combat, and one that deserves to become very big. What &quot;Tower of Mask&quot; does so splendidly well is make combat feel alive and real-time, in a tile-based game.\u201d<br>84 \u2013 Buried Treasure<br><br>\u201c\u201cTower of Mask\u201d solves the problems that have long plagued real-time grid-based dungeon crawlers by simply and creatively adding free camera movement and targeted attacks alongside movement. It is not a complex game, but it is certainly well done, and adds a variety of enemy designs, puzzles, and other content that will keep you engaged until the end.\u201d<br>82 \u2013 IndoGamia<br>",
